OL,3,GNEWSARape arrest after woman attacked
OL,4,Aon woodland path
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Frape after a woman was attacked on a
OL,8,Fwoodland path.
OL,10,FDorset Police said the woman, aged in
OL,11,Fher 40s, reported being attacked in the
OL,12,FBoscombe area of Bournemouth on
OL,13,FWednesday at about 21:00 BST.
OL,15,FWoodland Walk - a path that runs
OL,16,Fbetween the centre of Boscombe and the
OL,17,Fseafront - was cordoned off until
OL,18,FThursday afternoon.
OL,20,FOfficers said the arrested man was aged
OL,21,Fin his 60s and from Bournemouth.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
